@startuml
title TARGET primera migracion - opt-in y cloud vacio
actor Owner
participant "Mobile o Web importer" as client
database "SQLite / backup JSON" as local
participant API
database "PostgreSQL staging/active" as db
Owner -> client : Login/verificar email + consentir import
client -> local : Backup/snapshot consistente + punto corte
client -> API : Reservar import/hash/vacio
API -> db : Reserva owner/generation
client -> API : Chunks checksum idempotentes
API -> db : Staging privado
API -> API : Validar 8 colecciones / snapshots / IDs
client -> API : Commit import
API -> db : BEGIN lock / verificar sigue vacio / activar todo
alt Fallo
  API -> db : ROLLBACK
  API --> client : Error / resume sin dataset parcial
else Exito
  API -> db : COMMIT receipt + baseline
  API --> client : ACK inventory/generation/cursor
  client -> local : Adoptar replica / liberar outbox posterior
end
note over client,db : Cloud no vacio: no merge/reemplazo automatico.
@enduml
